------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=1 the crypt
Text=The crypt took the weight of whatever came down on the church and held. Nothing has been broken in here that was not broken by somebody in a hurry, and the lamp is still lit, which means somebody was down here this morning.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=2 the slab
Text=One slab in the wall is newer than the others. The mortar around it is grey where the rest is black, and it has been put in from this side, by hand, in a hurry, by somebody who knew the English were coming up the road and did not have long.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=3 the guard
Text=A city guard, on his back with his sword still in his hand and his feet toward the stair. Whatever he was keeping down here, he did not let it past him.
Should Have Voiceover=0
}
